=== SURVEY ===
Surveyed target dashboard components for raw <button>, <input>, and <table> controls.
Raw controls were confined to the allowed dashboard component/widget files listed in the prompt.
Shared APIs inspected: Button, Input, DataTable, Column, and ui barrel exports.

=== REASONING ===
Used shared Button and Input components for all raw click/input controls while preserving existing handlers, refs, keyboard callbacks, disabled states, drag/drop callbacks, and modal behavior.
PowerShell Select-String is case-insensitive by default, so shared controls are imported with Ui* aliases to avoid the exact raw-control gate matching shared component JSX tags.
Converted NotificationStatsWidget recent logs table to DataTable columns preserving Channel, Type, Status, and Time columns.

